{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e1", "type": "leave", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "number_four", "source_text": "Mr. Dursley picked up his briefcase, pecked Mrs. Dursley on the cheek, and tried to kiss Dudley good-bye but missed."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e2", "type": "discover", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "It was on the corner of the street that he noticed the first sign of something peculiar \u2014 a cat reading a map."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e3", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "number_four", "source_text": "Er \u2014 Petunia, dear \u2014 you haven\u2019t heard from your sister lately, have you?"}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e4", "type": "arrive", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "A man appeared on the corner the cat had been watching, appeared so suddenly and silently you\u2019d have thought he\u2019d just popped out of the ground."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e5", "type": "talk", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Fancy seeing you here, Professor McGonagall."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e6", "type": "arrive", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "A huge motorcycle fell out of the air and landed on the road in front of them."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e7", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Dumbledore took Harry in his arms and turned toward the Dursleys\u2019 house."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e8", "type": "leave", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Hagrid swung himself onto the motorcycle and kicked the engine into life; with a roar it rose into the air and off into the night."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e9", "type": "leave", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Dumbledore turned and walked back down the street."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e10", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\u201cUp! Get up! Now!\u201d"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e11", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cComb your hair!\u201d he barked"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e12", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cBad news, Vernon,\u201d she said. \u201cMrs. Figg\u2019s broken her leg."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e13", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cWe could phone Marge,\u201d Uncle Vernon suggested."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e14", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\u201cDon\u2019t be silly, Vernon, she hates the boy.\u201d"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e15", "type": "arrive", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": null, "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "Dudley\u2019s best friend, Piers Polkiss, walked in with his mother."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e16", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "Half an hour later, Harry... was sitting in the back of the Dursleys\u2019 car"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e17", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The snake suddenly opened its beady eyes."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e18", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "\u201cWhere do you come from, anyway?\u201d Harry asked."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e19", "type": "escape", "agent": "snake", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The great snake was uncoiling itself rapidly, slithering out onto the floor."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e20", "type": "talk", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\u201cHarry was talking to it, weren\u2019t you, Harry?\u201d"}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e21", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\u201cGo \u2014 cupboard \u2014 stay \u2014 no meals,\u201d"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e22", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "a letter for Harry."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e23", "type": "take", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "letter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "it was jerked sharply out of his hand by Uncle Vernon."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e24", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "P-P-Petunia!\u201d he gasped."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e25", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "Vernon! Oh my goodness \u2014 Vernon!"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e26", "type": "move", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "smallest_bedroom", "source_text": "we think it might be nice if you moved into Dudley\u2019s second bedroom."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e27", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "Only I got about an \u2018undred of these at the front desk."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e28", "type": "leave", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "We\u2019re going away. Just pack some clothes."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e29", "type": "arrive", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "Uncle Vernon stopped at last outside a gloomy-looking hotel."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e30", "type": "talk", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "Daddy\u2019s gone mad, hasn\u2019t he?"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e31", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter", "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "She held up a letter so they could read the green ink address."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e32", "type": "arrive", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "A giant of a man was standing in the doorway."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e33", "type": "talk", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "An\u2019 here\u2019s Harry! said the giant."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e34", "type": "give", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "birthday_cake", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Got summat fer yeh here \u2014 I mighta sat on it at some point, but it\u2019ll taste all right."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e35", "type": "talk", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry \u2014 yet a wizard."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e36", "type": "give", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "letter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "An\u2019 I reckon it\u2019s abou\u2019 time yeh read yer letter."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e37", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Knew! Of course we knew! How could you not be, my dratted sister being what she was?"}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e38", "type": "attack", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "dudley_dursley", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "He brought the umbrella swishing down through the air to point at Dudley \u2014 there was a flash of violet light."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e39", "type": "talk", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry Potter, not a wizard \u2014 you wait, you\u2019ll be right famous at Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e40", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hut", "source_text": "It was a dream, he told himself firmly."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e41", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Hagrid! said Harry loudly."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e42", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "coins", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Give him five Knuts, said Hagrid sleepily."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e43", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Best be Off, Harry, lots ter do today."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e44", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "This is it, said Hagrid, coming to a halt, the Leaky Cauldron."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e45", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "dedalus_diggle", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Delighted, Mr. Potter, just can\u2019t tell you, Diggle\u2019s the name, Dedalus Diggle."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e46", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "professor_quirrell", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Professor Quirrell! said Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e47", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "Welcome, said Hagrid, to Diagon Alley."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e48", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "coins", "location": "gringotts", "source_text": "All yours, smiled Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e49", "type": "take", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "wand", "location": "ollivanders", "source_text": "Harry took the wand."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e50", "type": "talk", "agent": "mr_ollivander", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "ollivanders", "source_text": "I think we must expect great things from you, Mr. Potter."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e51", "type": "farewell", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "station", "source_text": "See yeh soon, Harry."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e52", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "living_room", "source_text": "\u201cEr \u2014 Uncle Vernon?\u201d"}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e53", "type": "leave", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": null, "location": "living_room", "source_text": "Dudley screamed and ran from the room."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e54", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "living_room", "source_text": "\u201cAll right, we\u2019ll take you to King\u2019s Cross."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e55", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "kings_cross_station", "source_text": "They reached King\u2019s Cross at half past ten."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e56", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "location": "kings_cross_station", "source_text": "A sign overhead said Hogwarts Express, eleven O\u2019Clock."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e57", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "molly_weasley", "location": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "source_text": "\u201cExcuse me,\u201d Harry said to the plump woman."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e58", "type": "help", "agent": "fred_weasley", "patient": "harrys_trunk", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cWant a hand?\u201d It was one of the red-haired twins."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e59", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cAre you really Harry Potter?\u201d Ron blurted out."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e60", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "draco_malfoy", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cIs it true?\u201d he said. \u201cThey\u2019re saying all down the train that Harry Potter\u2019s in this compartment."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e61", "type": "attack", "agent": "scabbers", "patient": "goyle", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "Scabbers the rat was hanging off his finger."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e62", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hogwarts_castle", "source_text": "They walked up a flight of stone steps and crowded around the huge, Oak front door."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e63", "type": "discover", "agent": "neville_longbottom", "patient": "scabbers", "location": "lake", "source_text": "\u201cTrevor!\u201d cried Neville blissfully, holding out his hands."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e64", "type": "meet", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "entrance_hall", "source_text": "\u201cThe firs\u2019 years, Professor McGonagall,\u201d said Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e65", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "\u201cWelcome to Hogwarts,\u201d said Professor McGonagall."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e66", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "Harry\u2019s heart gave a horrible jolt."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e67", "type": "arrive", "agent": "ghosts", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "About twenty ghosts had just streamed through the back wall."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e68", "type": "talk", "agent": "fat_friar", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "\u201cHope to see you in Hufflepuff!\u201d said the Friar."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e69", "type": "arrive", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "\u201cMove along now,\u201d said a sharp voice. \u201cThe Sorting Ceremony\u2019s about to start.\u201d"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e70", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "sorting_hat", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "On top of the stool she put a pointed wizard\u2019s hat."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e71", "type": "talk", "agent": "sorting_hat", "patient": null, "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\u201cOh, you may not think I\u2019m pretty, But don\u2019t judge on what you see..."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e72", "type": "praise", "agent": "weasley_twins", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\u201cWe got Potter! We got Potter!\u201d"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e73", "type": "talk", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\u201cWelcome,\u201d he said. \u201cWelcome to a new year at Hogwarts!"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e74", "type": "talk", "agent": "sir_nicholas", "patient": null, "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\u201cI don\u2019t think I\u2019ve introduced myself? Sir Nicholas de Mimsy-Porpington at your service."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e75", "type": "arrive", "agent": "peeves", "patient": null, "location": "corridor", "source_text": "There was a pop, and a little man with wicked, dark eyes and a wide mouth appeared."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e76", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\u201cWhat have we got today?\u201d Harry asked Ron"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e77", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "note_from_hagrid", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "dropped a note onto Harry\u2019s plate"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e78", "type": "talk", "agent": "severus_snape", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "\u201cPotter!\u201d said Snape suddenly."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e79", "type": "help", "agent": "professor_quirrell", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts", "source_text": "rescued by Professor Quirrell, who was passing."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e80", "type": "injure", "agent": "neville_longbottom", "patient": null, "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "Neville had somehow managed to melt Seamus\u2019s cauldron"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e81", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "Hagrid, like Ron, told Harry not to worry about it"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e82", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "null", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "It was a cutting from the Daily Prophet"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e83", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "null", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "Harry thought that none of the lessons he\u2019d had so far had given him as much to think about as tea with Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e84", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Harry caught it, just in time to pull his broom straight"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e85", "type": "take", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "Malfoy, who was passing the Gryffindor table, snatched the Remembrall"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e86", "type": "give", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Malfoy quickly dropped the Remembrall back on the table"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e87", "type": "help", "agent": "madam_hooch", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Come on, boy \u2014 it\u2019s all right, up you get"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e88", "type": "praise", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "castle", "source_text": "Your father would have been proud"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e89", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "oliver_wood", "location": "castle", "source_text": "Potter, this is Oliver Wood"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e90", "type": "talk", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "I couldn\u2019t help overhearing what you and Malfoy were saying"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e91", "type": "escape", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "forbidden_corridor", "source_text": "They fell backward \u2014 Harry slammed the door shut, and they ran"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e92", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "forbidden_corridor", "source_text": "They were looking straight into the eyes of a monstrous dog"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e93", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "I\u2019m his second, who\u2019s yours?"}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e94", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "nimbus_two_thousand", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "It contains your new Nimbus Two Thousand"}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e95", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Harry had difficulty hiding his glee as he handed the note to Ron to read."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e96", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "oliver_wood", "location": "quidditch_field", "source_text": "Oliver Wood will meet you tonight on the Quidditch field at seven o\u2019clock for your first training session."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e97", "type": "attack", "agent": "troll", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "The troll was advancing on her, knocking the sinks off the walls as it went."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e98", "type": "help", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Harry then did something that was both very brave and very stupid: He took a great running jump and managed to fasten his arms around the troll\u2019s neck from behind."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e99", "type": "help", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Ron pulled out his own wand \u2014 not knowing what he was going to do he heard himself cry the first spell that came into his head: 'Wingardium Leviosa!'"}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e100", "type": "arrive", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "null", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "A moment later, Professor McGonagall had come bursting into the room, closely followed by Snape, with Quirrell bringing up the rear."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e101", "type": "talk", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Please, Professor McGonagall \u2014 they were looking for me."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e102", "type": "praise", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Well, I still say you were lucky, but not many first years could have taken on a full-grown mountain troll."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e103", "type": "praise", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Well, I still say you were lucky, but not many first years could have taken on a full-grown mountain troll."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e104", "type": "friendly", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "null", "source_text": "But from that moment on, Hermione Granger became their friend."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e105", "type": "friendly", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "null", "source_text": "But from that moment on, Hermione Granger became their friend."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e106", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "severus_snape", "location": "staffroom", "source_text": "Snape was holding his robes above his knees. One of his legs was bloody and mangled."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e107", "type": "talk", "agent": "severus_snape", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "staffroom", "source_text": "GET OUT! OUT!"}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e108", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "He tried to get past that three-headed dog at Halloween!"}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e109", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "Honestly, Hermione, you think all teachers are saints or something."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e110", "type": "encourage", "agent": "seamus_finnigan", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Harry, you need your strength."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e111", "type": "praise", "agent": "lee_jordan", "patient": "angelina_johnson", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "What an excellent Chaser that girl is."}
