{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e113", "type": "discover", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "severus_snape", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Snape was in the middle of the stands opposite them."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e114", "type": "help", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Bright blue flames shot from her wand onto the hem of Snape\u2019s robes."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e115", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "golden_snitch", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "I\u2019ve got the Snitch!"}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e116", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "It was Snape, Hermione and I saw him."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e117", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "fluffy", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "How do you know about Fluffy?"}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e1", "type": "think", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Fear flooded him."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e2", "type": "meet", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Fancy seeing you here, Professor McGonagall."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e3", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "albus_dumbledore", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Lily and James Potter are \u2014 are \u2014 that they\u2019re \u2014 dead."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e4", "type": "arrive", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "A huge motorcycle fell out of the air and landed on the road in front of them."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e5", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Dumbledore took Harry in his arms."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e6", "type": "leave", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "Hagrid swung himself onto the motorcycle and kicked the engine into life."}
{"chapter": 0, "event_id": "e7", "type": "leave", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "He turned on his heel and with a swish of his cloak, he was gone."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e8", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\"Up! Get up! Now!\""}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e9", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\"Comb your hair!\""}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e10", "type": "talk", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\"Thirty-six,\" he said, looking up at his mother and father."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e11", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "dudley_dursley", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\"And we\u2019ll buy you another two presents while we\u2019re out today.\""}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e12", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\"We could phone Marge,\" Uncle Vernon suggested."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e13", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "\"Don\u2019t be silly, Vernon, she hates the boy.\""}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e14", "type": "arrive", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": null, "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "Piers Polkiss, walked in with his mother."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e15", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "Half an hour later, Harry... was sitting in the back of the Dursleys\u2019 car."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e16", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "zoo", "source_text": "It was a very sunny Saturday and the zoo was crowded with families."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e17", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The snake suddenly opened its beady eyes."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e18", "type": "escape", "agent": "snake", "patient": null, "location": "reptile_house", "source_text": "The great snake was uncoiling itself rapidly, slithering out onto the floor."}
{"chapter": 1, "event_id": "e19", "type": "talk", "agent": "piers_polkiss", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "dursleys_house", "source_text": "\"Harry was talking to it, weren\u2019t you, Harry?\""}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e20", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter_for_harry", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "a letter for Harry."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e21", "type": "take", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "letter_for_harry", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "it was jerked sharply out of his hand by Uncle Vernon."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e22", "type": "talk", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "P-P-Petunia!"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e23", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "kitchen", "source_text": "Vernon! Oh my goodness \u2014 Vernon!"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e24", "type": "move", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "smallest_bedroom", "source_text": "we think it might be nice if you moved into Dudley\u2019s second bedroom."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e25", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "letter_for_harry", "location": "railview_hotel", "source_text": "Only I got about an \u2018undred of these at the front desk."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e26", "type": "leave", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "We\u2019re going away."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e27", "type": "arrive", "agent": "uncle_vernon", "patient": null, "location": "shack_on_rock", "source_text": "Perched on top of the rock was the most miserable little shack you could imagine."}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e28", "type": "talk", "agent": "dudley_dursley", "patient": "aunt_petunia", "location": "shack_on_rock", "source_text": "Daddy\u2019s gone mad, hasn\u2019t he?"}
{"chapter": 2, "event_id": "e29", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "shack_on_rock", "source_text": "Someone was outside, knocking to come in."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e30", "type": "arrive", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": null, "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "A giant of a man was standing in the doorway."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e31", "type": "talk", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "An\u2019 here\u2019s Harry! said the giant."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e32", "type": "give", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "birthday_cake", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Got summat fer yeh here \u2014 I mighta sat on it at some point, but it\u2019ll taste all right."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e33", "type": "talk", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry \u2014 yet a wizard."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e34", "type": "give", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "letter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "An\u2019 I reckon it\u2019s abou\u2019 time yeh read yer letter."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e35", "type": "talk", "agent": "aunt_petunia", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Knew! Of course we knew! How could you not be, my dratted sister being what she was?"}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e36", "type": "attack", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "dudley_dursley", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "He brought the umbrella swishing down through the air to point at Dudley \u2014 there was a flash of violet light."}
{"chapter": 3, "event_id": "e37", "type": "talk", "agent": "rubeus_hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut_on_the_rock", "source_text": "Harry Potter, not a wizard \u2014 you wait, you\u2019ll be right famous at Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e38", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hut", "source_text": "It was a dream, he told himself firmly."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e39", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Hagrid! said Harry loudly. There\u2019s an owl."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e40", "type": "give", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "owl", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Harry counted out five little bronze coins."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e41", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hut", "source_text": "Best be Off, Harry, lots ter do today."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e42", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "This is it, said Hagrid, coming to a halt, the Leaky Cauldron."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e43", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "dedalus_diggle", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Delighted, Mr. Potter, just can\u2019t tell you, Diggle\u2019s the name, Dedalus Diggle."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e44", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "professor_quirrell", "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "Professor Quirrell! said Hagrid. Harry, Professor Quirrell will be one of your teachers at Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e45", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "Welcome, said Hagrid, to Diagon Alley."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e46", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "coins", "location": "gringotts", "source_text": "All yours, smiled Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e47", "type": "give", "agent": "mr_ollivander", "patient": "wand", "location": "diagon_alley", "source_text": "The wand chooses the wizard, remember."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e48", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "leaky_cauldron", "source_text": "The late afternoon sun hung low in the sky as Harry and Hagrid made their way back down Diagon Alley."}
{"chapter": 4, "event_id": "e49", "type": "farewell", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "train", "source_text": "See yeh soon, Harry."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e50", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "uncle_vernon", "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "\u201cEr \u2014 Uncle Vernon?\u201d"}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e51", "type": "leave", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "privet_drive", "source_text": "They reached King\u2019s Cross at half past ten."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e52", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "location": "kings_cross_station", "source_text": "A sign overhead said Hogwarts Express, eleven O\u2019clock."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e53", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "platform_nine_and_three_quarters", "source_text": "\u201cHello, dear,\u201d she said. \u201cFirst time at Hogwarts? Ron\u2019s new, too.\u201d"}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e54", "type": "help", "agent": "fred_weasley", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hogwarts_express", "source_text": "\u201cWant a hand?\u201d It was one of the red-haired twins."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e55", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "compartment", "source_text": "\u201cAre you really Harry Potter?\u201d Ron blurted out."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e56", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "compartment", "source_text": "\u201cI\u2019m Hermione Granger, by the way, who are you.\u201d"}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e57", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "draco_malfoy", "location": "compartment", "source_text": "\u201cIs it true?\u201d he said. \u201cThey\u2019re saying all down the train that Harry Potter\u2019s in this compartment."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e58", "type": "attack", "agent": "scabbers", "patient": "goyle", "location": "compartment", "source_text": "Scabbers the rat was hanging off his finger, sharp little teeth sunk deep into Goyle\u2019s knuckle."}
{"chapter": 5, "event_id": "e59", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "hogwarts", "source_text": "\u201cYe\u2019 all get yer firs\u2019 sight o\u2019 Hogwarts in a sec,\u201d Hagrid called over his shoulder."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e60", "type": "arrive", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "entrance_hall", "source_text": "The door swung open at once."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e61", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "first_years", "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "Welcome to Hogwarts."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e62", "type": "meet", "agent": "first_years", "patient": "ghosts", "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "About twenty ghosts had just streamed through the back wall."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e63", "type": "arrive", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": null, "location": "small_chamber", "source_text": "Professor McGonagall had returned."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e64", "type": "arrive", "agent": "first_years", "patient": null, "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "They walked out of the chamber, back across the hall, and through a pair of double doors into the Great Hall."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e65", "type": "talk", "agent": "sorting_hat", "patient": "first_years", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "The hat began to sing."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e66", "type": "praise", "agent": "gryffindor_table", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "The Gryffindor table exploded with cheers."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e67", "type": "talk", "agent": "albus_dumbledore", "patient": "students", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Welcome to a new year at Hogwarts!"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e68", "type": "talk", "agent": "sir_nicholas", "patient": "gryffindor_first_years", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "I don\u2019t think I\u2019ve introduced myself? Sir Nicholas de Mimsy-Porpington at your service."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e69", "type": "talk", "agent": "peeves", "patient": "first_years", "location": "corridor", "source_text": "Oooooooh! Ickle Firsties! What fun!"}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e70", "type": "arrive", "agent": "first_years", "patient": null, "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "They found themselves in the Gryffindor common room."}
{"chapter": 6, "event_id": "e71", "type": "think", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "Perhaps Harry had eaten a bit too much, because he had a very strange dream."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e72", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "\"What have we got today?\" Harry asked Ron"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e73", "type": "give", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "note_from_hagrid", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "dropped a note onto Harry\u2019s plate"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e74", "type": "talk", "agent": "severus_snape", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "\"Potter!\" said Snape suddenly."}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e75", "type": "injure", "agent": "neville_longbottom", "patient": null, "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "moaned in pain as angry red boils sprang up"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e76", "type": "help", "agent": "seamus_finnigan", "patient": "neville_longbottom", "location": "dungeons", "source_text": "Take him up to the hospital wing"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e77", "type": "talk", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "Hagrid, like Ron, told Harry not to worry"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e78", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "note_from_hagrid", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Harry tore it open at once"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e79", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "null", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "It was a cutting from the Daily Prophet"}
{"chapter": 7, "event_id": "e80", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hagrid_house", "source_text": "\u201cHagrid!\u201d said Harry, \u201cthat Gringotts breakin happened on my birthday!"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e81", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "remembrall", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Harry caught it, just in time to pull his broom straight."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e82", "type": "talk", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "grounds", "source_text": "Potter, follow me, now."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e83", "type": "meet", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "oliver_wood", "location": "castle", "source_text": "Potter, this is Oliver Wood."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e84", "type": "praise", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "castle", "source_text": "Your father would have been proud."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e85", "type": "talk", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dining_hall", "source_text": "Having a last meal, Potter?"}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e86", "type": "challenge", "agent": "draco_malfoy", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "dining_hall", "source_text": "Wizard\u2019s duel. Wands only \u2014 no contact."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e87", "type": "escape", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "forbidden_corridor", "source_text": "RUN! Harry yelled, and the four of them sprinted down the gallery."}
{"chapter": 8, "event_id": "e88", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": null, "location": "forbidden_corridor", "source_text": "They were looking straight into the eyes of a monstrous dog."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e89", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "nimbus_two_thousand", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "It contains your new Nimbus Two Thousand"}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e90", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "great_hall", "source_text": "Harry had difficulty hiding his glee as he handed the note to Ron to read."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e91", "type": "meet", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "oliver_wood", "location": "quidditch_field", "source_text": "Oliver Wood will meet you tonight on the Quidditch field at seven o\u2019clock for your first training session."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e92", "type": "teach", "agent": "oliver_wood", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_field", "source_text": "I\u2019m just going to teach you the rules this evening"}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e93", "type": "attack", "agent": "troll", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "The troll was advancing on her, knocking the sinks off the walls as it went."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e94", "type": "help", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Harry then did something that was both very brave and very stupid: He took a great running jump and managed to fasten his arms around the troll\u2019s neck from behind."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e95", "type": "help", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "hermione_granger", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Ron pulled out his own wand \u2014 not knowing what he was going to do he heard himself cry the first spell that came into his head: \u201cWingardium Leviosa!\u201d"}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e96", "type": "arrive", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "null", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "A moment later, Professor McGonagall had come bursting into the room"}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e97", "type": "talk", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "professor_mcgonagall", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "Please, Professor McGonagall \u2014 they were looking for me."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e98", "type": "praise", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "You each win Gryffindor five points."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e99", "type": "praise", "agent": "professor_mcgonagall", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "girls_bathroom", "source_text": "You each win Gryffindor five points."}
{"chapter": 9, "event_id": "e100", "type": "friendship", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "But from that moment on, Hermione Granger became their friend."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e101", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "severus_snape", "location": "staffroom", "source_text": "Snape was holding his robes above his knees. One of his legs was bloody and mangled."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e102", "type": "talk", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "ron_weasley", "location": "gryffindor_common_room", "source_text": "In a low whisper, Harry told them what he\u2019d seen."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e103", "type": "encourage", "agent": "oliver_wood", "patient": "gryffindor_team", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "This is the best team Gryffindor\u2019s had in years. We\u2019re going to win. I know it."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e104", "type": "attack", "agent": "marcus_flint", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Marcus Flint had blocked Harry on purpose, and Harry\u2019s broom spun off course."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e105", "type": "discover", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "severus_snape", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Snape was in the middle of the stands opposite them. He had his eyes fixed on Harry and was muttering nonstop under his breath."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e106", "type": "help", "agent": "hermione_granger", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "Bright blue flames shot from her wand onto the hem of Snape\u2019s robes."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e107", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "golden_snitch", "location": "quidditch_pitch", "source_text": "I\u2019ve got the Snitch!"}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e108", "type": "talk", "agent": "ron_weasley", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "It was Snape, Ron was explaining, Hermione and I saw him."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e109", "type": "discover", "agent": "harry_potter", "patient": "hagrid", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "I found out something about him, he told Hagrid."}
{"chapter": 10, "event_id": "e110", "type": "discover", "agent": "hagrid", "patient": "harry_potter", "location": "hagrids_hut", "source_text": "How do you know about Fluffy? he said."}
